WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.524 --> 00:00:15.766
and Jinying could not find the monkey.

2
00:00:15.786 --> 00:00:19.769
"Maybe it left the property," said Jinying.

3
00:00:20.950 --> 00:00:25.314
Outside, Mandy was amazed at Jinying's courtyard house.

4
00:00:26.234 --> 00:00:28.336
It took up an entire block.

5
00:00:30.904 --> 00:00:33.785
"Why do you have so many little buildings?"

6
00:00:34.466 --> 00:00:35.066
she asked.

7
00:00:35.086 --> 00:00:39.388
"Each building has a different purpose," he replied.

8
00:00:39.408 --> 00:00:42.890
"We receive guests in the main house.

9
00:00:43.970 --> 00:00:47.031
My father and mother have their own buildings and so do I."

10
00:00:48.432 --> 00:00:50.533
They walked past Jinying's house.

11
00:00:51.874 --> 00:00:58.236
Mandy noticed that some people wore shiny silk, like Jinying.

12
00:00:58.256 --> 00:01:02.138
But others wore dark clothes made from rough material.

13
00:01:03.439 --> 00:01:06.301
Some people on the street called out to Jinying.

14
00:01:06.321 --> 00:01:11.083
"Congratulations, Master Jinying," they said.

15
00:01:12.584 --> 00:01:14.926
Jinying nodded but kept walking.

16
00:01:14.946 --> 00:01:18.027
"There it is!"

17
00:01:18.848 --> 00:01:21.389
Mandy suddenly caught sight of the monkey.

18
00:01:22.850 --> 00:01:25.992
It was climbing onto the roof of a strange building.

19
00:01:28.444 --> 00:01:31.567
"What a funny house," giggled Mandy.

20
00:01:31.587 --> 00:01:35.850
"Why is it built so open to the outside?"

21
00:01:35.870 --> 00:01:40.934
"It gets very hot here sometimes," replied Jinying.

22
00:01:40.954 --> 00:01:45.198
"People like to meet, relax, and keep cool in these places."

23
00:01:46.619 --> 00:01:48.921
Jinying reached into his pocket.

24
00:01:49.842 --> 00:01:51.843
He had some sunflower seeds.

25
00:01:53.104 --> 00:01:57.148
He gave them to Mandy, and she held them out to the monkey.

26
00:01:58.416 --> 00:02:01.458
It came down from the roof and sniffed her hand.

27
00:02:02.719 --> 00:02:04.400
Mandy grabbed the monkey.

28
00:02:05.741 --> 00:02:10.164
Suddenly a loud voice called out, "That's my monkey!"

29
00:02:11.345 --> 00:02:12.466
It was the trainer.

30
00:02:13.066 --> 00:02:16.248
He was on a horse and waving a large stick.

31
00:02:16.268 --> 00:02:18.470
"What should we do?"

32
00:02:19.270 --> 00:02:20.131
Mandy asked.

33
00:02:21.392 --> 00:02:23.113
The monkey clung to her shirt.

34
00:02:23.133 --> 00:02:24.874
"Come with me."

35
00:02:25.615 --> 00:02:26.976
Jinying took her arm.

36
00:02:27.748 --> 00:02:28.648
"I have an idea."

37
00:02:29.929 --> 00:02:33.850
Vinnie, meanwhile, was trying to get back to the square.

38
00:02:34.830 --> 00:02:37.831
He walked to the end of a street and stared.

39
00:02:37.851 --> 00:02:40.372
"I can't believe it!

40
00:02:40.792 --> 00:02:45.073
This whole city is surrounded by a wall," he said aloud.

41
00:02:46.293 --> 00:02:49.754
Backing away, Vinnie bumped into someone.

42
00:02:50.474 --> 00:02:52.295
They both fell to the ground.

43
00:02:52.315 --> 00:02:55.856
"I'm sorry," cried Vinnie.

44
00:02:56.904 --> 00:03:00.926
He turned and saw a bald man wearing a long robe.

45
00:03:02.206 --> 00:03:05.147
Next to him was a walking stick and book.

46
00:03:06.408 --> 00:03:07.228
"Are you hurt?"

47
00:03:07.949 --> 00:03:08.629
asked Vinnie.

48
00:03:09.809 --> 00:03:11.530
"I think I twisted my ankle.

49
00:03:12.751 --> 00:03:13.951
Would you mind helping me?"

50
00:03:14.751 --> 00:03:15.692
the man asked.

51
00:03:15.712 --> 00:03:19.813
"Of course," Vinnie replied.

52
00:03:21.014 --> 00:03:23.615
He put the man's arm around his shoulder.

53
00:03:23.635 --> 00:03:25.776
"Where are we going?"

54
00:03:26.584 --> 00:03:27.405
Vinnie asked.

55
00:03:28.505 --> 00:03:32.567
"To the monastery, over there," said the man, pointing.

56
00:03:34.228 --> 00:03:39.790
On the other side of the city, Mandy and Jinying were running from the trainer.

57
00:03:41.251 --> 00:03:45.153
They tried to hide behind a wagon piled high with wheat.

58
00:03:45.173 --> 00:03:48.374
"Thieves! I see you!"

59
00:03:49.135 --> 00:03:51.176
The monkey trainer had found them.
